      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتُدَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتُدَ</span></b> ,] (O, L, Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتَادٌ</span>
(O, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتَادَةٌ</span>, (O, L, K,) <i>It</i> (a thing,
