       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتُدَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتَادٌ</span>
(L, TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتَادَةٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was,</i> or
<i>became, great, big,</i> or <i>bulky.</i> (L, TA.)

